# Public lab-api vhost (D · #533) — ROUTING OWNED BY THIS REPO.
#
# The shared Caddy edge engine is owned by podcast_scraper (ADR-114); this file
# is a tenant vhost dropped into /etc/caddy/sites/orrery-lab-api.caddy by
# ops/deploy_caddy_vhosts.sh (`caddy adapt`-gated, then restart).
#
# Upstream: the orrery-lab-api container on loopback 8093 (compose service
# `lab-api`). 8093 was ADR-114's reserved slot — the port-map update rides in
# the prepared cross-repo ADR-114 amendment (operator-gated push; 8092 is the
# podcast player's own OAuth AS, NOT ours). The server enforces its own auth
# (OAuth 2.1 AS + bearer-gated /ask) and rate limits — the vhost only
# terminates TLS and proxies.
#
# DNS: lab-api.orrerylearn.com must resolve to the box BEFORE this file lands,
# or ACME retries burn Let's Encrypt rate limits (same caveat as orrery.caddy).
#
# Rollback: rm /etc/caddy/sites/orrery-lab-api.caddy && sudo systemctl restart caddy.
lab-api.orrerylearn.com {
	import hardened
	reverse_proxy 127.0.0.1:8093
}
